# Command output (RTK)

If RTK (Rust Token Killer) is installed on the machine, Shell commands may be wrapped to condense output. Treat condensed results as complete.

- Prefer normal commands; only re-run unfiltered when output is unusable.
- For full Playwright logs when needed: `RTK_DISABLED=1 npx playwright test ...`
